# Holdings → research → public snapshot

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  slack["Slack #ledger-holdings"] --> auto["Cursor Automation<br/>primary: ledger-private"]
  auto --> private["ledger-private main<br/>holdings_nordnet.yaml"]
  auto --> research["Public ledger clone<br/>invest research"]
  research --> scrub["dashboard/research<br/>scrubbed JSON"]
  scrub --> orbit["Orbit public/ledger-research<br/>alextouvras.com"]
```

Holdings stay private. The Orbit page is the scrubbed snapshot only (no brokers, no €).
